2026-05-10 16:33:56,529 - INFO - 
2026-05-10 16:33:56,529 - INFO - Therefore, your friend is more aligned with the prevailing scientific understanding. Viewing addiction as a disease rather than a choice helps to reduce stigma and promotes more effective treatment approaches, such as medical intervention and therapy, rather than punitive measures.
