2026-05-10 16:44:45,207 - INFO - On the other hand, proponents of standardized testing argue that it provides a consistent and objective measure of student performance, which can be useful for comparing students across different schools and regions. However, these benefits do not fully address the issues of bias and inequality that can undermine the fairness of these tests.
2026-05-10 16:44:45,207 - INFO - 
